  "context": "Extend the unified tuning model with an explicit Databricks clustering strategy\nrepresentation rather than inferring from generic sorting fields. Apply the strategy\nin Databricks adapter lifecycle points where table format/state is known.\n\nKeep precedence rules explicit: liquid clustering, z-order, and none must be mutually\nunderstandable with clear conflict handling and warnings.\n\nAdd result metadata so downstream analysis can segment runs by applied strategy.\n",
